h support some might have  been expecting this information sooner  but a new blog post confirms that the  information will be announced early in  2022 so at launch players will be taking  part in a pre-season instead of a proper  season one in the preseason players will  find weekly missions and rewards as well  as limited time modes and curated  content from the battlefield portal  which is live right now battlefield  portal is a new platform within  battlefield 2042 that will let you  create and find experiences made by the  community give you access to settings  custom modes and a logic editor and more  when season one does arrive it will add  a new specialist of the battle pass more  portal content and maybe even some new  sites to see dice teased it was also  stated that launch is only the beginning  and dice is taking a new approach to  live service with not only a commitment  to new content but a goal of enhancing  the battlefield experience through  seasons that will continue to evolve the  world of battlefield 2042  now if we think a little bit more big  picture battlefield 2042's first year of  live service will include four seasons  four battle passes four new specialists  and new locations to explore battlefield  portal will get its own set of separate  live service updates over time as well  so buckle up battlefield fans it looks  like there's no shortage of content on  the way pokemon brilliant diamond and  shining pearl remakes of the 2006  classics will get a day 1 update the  patch will update the game to version  1.1.0 and nintendo recommends  downloading it before starting the game  it will require three gigs of space if  you downloaded the game from the  nintendo eshop you won't need to  download a separate update according to  the patch notes the update adds online  communication features for grand  underground super contest show in union  room and it allows you to receive gifts  using the mystery gift feature it also  adds more playable content like ramanus  park that opens up after you enter the  hall of fame adds more in-game cutscenes  and animations and even includes various  bug fixes the patch notes also tease  another update to come some time after  release which will increase the maximum  number of players who can battle and  trade in the union room as well as gws  training in jubalife city and the  coliseum future in pokemon centers for  the full list of patch notes be sure to  visit gamespot.com and if you've been  wondering what other new games or  content you can expect this year then  get ready for the game awards new  details were shared for the show that  will be held on december 9th with to 50  games being showcased in some capacity  with a double-digit number of those  games being new reveals  what is your dream game that you would  love to see revealed at the show let me  know in the comments and be sure to  subscribe to our channel because we'll  also be broadcasting the game awards  right here on december 9th thank you all  so much for watching and we'll catch you  next time  [Music]  you
 

